### Delivery Service — HTTP scenarios (Step 1 dev)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8082
### Requires Keycloak JWT (driver role for courier endpoints, admin role for payout report)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@deliveryId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@driverId   = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### 1. Register a new driver (id = JWT subject)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverJwt}}

{ "name": "Ruben", "vehicle": "BICYCLE" }

### 2. List deliveries available for self-assignment (US28)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/available
Authorization: Bearer {{driverJwt}}

### 3. Courier self-assigns a delivery (US27 / US32) — caller = JWT subject
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverJwt}}

{ "status": "ASSIGNED" }

### 4. Courier releases claim (US29) — only allowed while NOT ready-for-pickup
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverJwt}}

{ "status": "CANCELLED", "reason": "wrong pickup address" }

### 5. Once order ready-for-pickup event arrives, courier picks up (US30)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverJwt}}

{ "status": "PICKED_UP" }

### 6. Mark in-transit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverJwt}}

{ "status": "IN_TRANSIT" }

### 7. Mark delivered — triggers Payout calc + OrderDelivered AMQP event
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverJwt}}

{ "status": "DELIVERED" }

### 8. US35 — list courier's payouts + running total (driver role, guard enforces self-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/{{driverId}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{driverJwt}}

### 9. US38 — admin PDF report (admin role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payouts/report?from=2026-09-01T00:00:00&to=2026-10-31T23:59:59
Accept: application/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}

